<b>🎬 Radarr</b> · <font color="#3498db">✏️ Renamed</font>
<ul>
<li><b>Movie:</b> {{ trigger.payload_json.movie.title }} ({{ trigger.payload_json.movie.year }})</li>
<li><b>Files renamed:</b> {{ trigger.payload_json.renamedMovieFiles | length }}</li>
